    "Shortcuts starts the task. Background Keep-Alive helps longer agent work finish after Minis leaves the foreground, and notifications report when it starts and completes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shortcuts starts the task. Background Keep-Alive helps longer agent work finish after Minis leaves the foreground, and notifications report when it starts and completes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“快捷指令”负责启动任务。“后台保活”可帮助较长的 Agent 任务在 Minis 离开前台后继续完成；通知会报告开始和完成状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「捷徑」負責啟動任務。「背景保活」可幫助較長的 Agent 任務在 Minis 離開前景後繼續完成；通知會回報開始和完成狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
